01099F7214842C8017D7B82DA_es"",""title"":""Previa: el Man City visita al Liverpool en el gran duelo de Anfield"",""image"":""https://latest.fotmob.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Covers_Liverpool-Man-City-0810-1.png"",""description"":""Solo cinco equipos siguen invictos esta temporada en la Premier League y dos de ellos se enfrentan el domingo por la tarde en Anfield, donde el Liverpool recibe al líder, el Manchester City."",""lang"":""es"",""dateUpdated"":""2026-10-08T13:59:35Z"",""source"":""FotMob"",""shareUrl"":""https://www.fotmob.com/topnews/29884-preview-man-city-head-liverpool-anfield-showdown?utm_source=fotmob&lang=es""},{""id"":""D5B75AD01099F7214842C8017D7B82DA_it"",""title"":""Anteprima: il Man City ad Anfield contro il Liverpool"",""image"":""https://latest.fotmob.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Covers_Liverpool-Man-City-0810-1.png"",""description"":""Soltanto cinque squadre sono ancora imbattute in questa Premier League e due di queste si affrontano domenica pomeriggio ad Anfield, dove il Liverpool ospita la capolista Manchester City."",""lang"":""it"",""dateUpdated"":""2026-10-08T13:59:35Z"",""source"":""FotMob"",""shareUrl"":""https://www.fotmob.com/topnews/29884-preview-man-city-head-liverpool-anfield-showdown?utm_source=fotmob&lang=it""},{""id"":""D5B75AD01099F7214842C8017D7B82DA_pt-BR"",""title"":""Prévia: Manchester City visita o Liverpool em duelo em Anfield"",""image"":""https://latest.fotmob.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Covers_Liverpool-Man-City-0810-1.png"",""description"":""Apenas cinco equipes seguem invictas nesta edição da Premier League, e duas delas se enfrentam no domingo à tarde em Anfield, onde o Liverpool recebe o líder Manchester City."",""lang"":""pt-BR"",""dateUpdated"":""2026-10-08T13:59:35Z"",""source"":""FotMob"",""shareUrl"":""https://www.fotmob.com/topnews/29884-preview-man-city-head-liverpool-anfield-showdown?utm_source=fotmob&lang=pt-BR""},{""id"":""D5B75AD01099F7214842C8017D7B82DA_fr"",""title"":""Avant-match : Manchester City se rend à Liverpool pour un choc à Anfield"",""image"":""https://latest.fotmob.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Covers_Liverpool-Man-City-0810-1.png"",""description"":""Seules cinq équipes sont encore invaincues en Premier League cette saison, et deux d’entre elles s’affrontent dimanche après-midi à Anfield : Liverpool reçoit le leader, Manchester City."",""lang"":""fr"",""dateUpdated"":""2026-10-08T13:59:35Z"",""source"":""FotMob"",""shareUrl"":""https://www.fotmob.com/topnews/29884-preview-man-city-head-liverpool-anfield-showdown?utm_source=fotmob&lang=fr""},{""id"":""dslzy2l7msrj12uqh4her5gca_ar"",""title"":""هالاند يدعو مانشستر سيتي إلى «التكاتف» بعد قرار الدوري الإنجليزي الممتاز"",""image"":""https://images.performgroup.com/di/library/omnisport/4c/d9/erling-haaland_117fxt5y9d2ba15kru7zutldv8.jpg?t=541979153"",""description"":""بعد إدانة مانشستر سيتي بخرق قواعد الدوري الإنجليزي الممتاز، دعا إرلينغ هالاند جميع من في النادي إلى التكاتف."",""lang"":""ar"",""contentUrl"":""https://apigw.fotmob.com/searchapi/search?entity=id&term=dslzy2l7msrj12uqh4her5gca_ar"",""dateUpdated"":""2026-10-08T18:23:59Z"",""source"":""Opta"",""shareUrl"":""https://www.fotmob.com/news/dslzy2l7msrj12uqh4her5gca_ar--?utm_source=fotmob""},{""id"":""D5B75AD01099F7214842C8017D7B82DA_de"",""title"":""Vorschau: Man City gastiert zum Topspiel in Anfield"",""image"":""https://latest.fotmob.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Covers_Liverpool-Man-City-0810-1.png"",""description"":""Nur fünf Mannschaften sind in dieser Premier-League-Saison noch ungeschlagen."",""lang"":""de"",""dateUpdated"":""2026-10-08T13:59:35Z"",""source"":""FotMob"",""shareUrl"":""https://www.fotmob.com/topnews/29884-preview-man-city-head-liverpool-anfield-showdown?utm_source=fotmob&lang=de""},{""id"":""dslzy2l7msrj12uqh4her5gca_pt"",""title"":""Haaland apela à união no Man City após decisão da Premier League"",""image"":""https://images.performgroup.com/di/library/omnisport/4c/d9/erling-haaland_117fxt5y9d2ba15kru7zutldv8.jpg?t=